P('instantaneous-velocity','Out and back','Position rises during the outward leg and falls during the return. The finish is at the starting position, so the whole-trip change is zero.','Time (s)',[0,6],'Position (m)',[0,6],[S('Trip',[[0,0],[3,6],[6,0]])]);
P('acceleration','Velocity reaches zero','The line rises by 2 m/s each second. It reaches zero after 2 s even though the acceleration is still +2 m/s².','Time (s)',[0,2],'Velocity (m/s)',[-4,0],[S('Velocity',[[0,-4],[2,0]])]);
