P('projectiles','A horizontal launch curves downward','The object starts 1.22625 m high and lands 1.5 m across after 0.5 s. This is a no-drag path, not its speed graph.','Horizontal distance (m)',[0,1.5],'Height (m)',[0,1.5],[S('Flight path',sample(x=>1.22625-4.905*(x/3)**2,0,1.5))]);
P('unequal-heights','Use the actual starting height','The path starts 4.905 m high and reaches the floor 2 m across after 1 s. Height and horizontal distance use different drawing scales.','Horizontal distance (m)',[0,2],'Height (m)',[0,5],[S('Flight path',sample(x=>4.905*(1-(x/2)**2),0,2))]);
P('angled-launch','Up, then down','This ideal 30° launch returns to its starting height about 4.33 m away. Read the axes; the drawn angle is not the launch angle.','Horizontal distance (m)',[0,5],'Height (m)',[0,1],[S('Flight path',sample(x=>x/Math.sqrt(3)-9.8*x*x/(2*49*.75),0,5*Math.sqrt(3)/2))]);
