P('linear-drag','Drag slows the motion gradually','The model starts at 3 m/s. After the 2 s decay time it still moves at about 1.10 m/s.','Time (s)',[0,4],'Velocity (m/s)',[0,3],[S('Velocity',sample(t=>3*Math.exp(-t/2),0,4))]);
