P('field-not-intensity','Timing changes how light adds','Both beams individually give 9 W/m². Together they range from 36 W/m² at matching phase to zero half a cycle apart.','Phase difference (cycles)',[0,1],'Combined intensity (W/m²)',[0,36],[S('Coherent sum',sample(t=>18+18*Math.cos(2*Math.PI*t),0,1,48))]);
P('single-aperture','A bright centre between two zeros','For the stated wavelength and slit, the first dark bands are about ±0.005 rad. The centre-to-centre width between these zeros is about 0.010 rad.','Angle (rad)',[-.015,.015],'Intensity / centre intensity',[0,1],[S('Small-angle slit pattern',sample(a=>a===0?1:(Math.sin(Math.PI*a/.005)/(Math.PI*a/.005))**2,-.015,.015,120))]);
