P('lifetime-predicts-a-population-curve','An average population fades','At one mean lifetime, about 368 of the initial 1000 remain excited on average. This is not a countdown for one atom.','Time / mean lifetime',[0,3],'Expected excited atoms',[0,1000],[S('Expected population',sample(t=>1000*Math.exp(-t),0,3))]);
